SUMMARY:Shaun the Sheep: The Beast of Mossy Bottom
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12:30pm\, 2:20pm\, 4:10pm\, 6pm\, 7:50pm\nSHAUN THE SHEE
 P: THE BEAST OF MOSSY BOTTOM sees the residents of Mossy Bottom Farm looki
 ng forward to Halloween – until the clumsy Farmer trashes the Flock’s 
 beloved pumpkin patch! When Shaun turns MAD SCIENTIST to fix the problem\,
  things rapidly spiral out of control... With The Farmer missing and a wil
 d beast roaming the woods of Mossingham\, all the ingredients are in place
  for a monstrously fun family adventure.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com
 /movie/shaun-the-sheep-the-beast-of-mossy-bottom\nFrom Pushpin Boston: htt
 ps://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/shaun-the-sheep-the-beast-of-mos
 sy-bottom
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:00cfca950218a29e639d924cd7735f97371b1726@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20260919T013100Z
DTSTART:20260919T163000Z
DTEND:20260919T183000Z
SUMMARY:The Weight
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12:30pm\, 2:55pm\, 5:20pm\, 7:45pm\nWhen Samuel (Hawke) 
 is torn from his daughter and sent to a brutal prison\, Warden Clancy (Cro
 we) offers a high-stakes proposition: smuggle gold out of a remote mine wi
 th a dangerous crew of prisoners and he’ll win his freedom. But as the g
 roup journeys into the unforgiving wilderness\, the real threat isn’t th
 e terrain - it’s the betrayal and violence festering within their ranks.
  Surrounded by greed\, suspicion\, and danger\, Samuel must risk everythin
 g to reunite with his child.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/the-w
 eight\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/the-weight
END:VEVENT
