BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:4ca683a6a0b679f826a620f6db766d42c9b14437@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20260919T013100Z
DTSTART:20260919T170000Z
DTEND:20260919T190000Z
SUMMARY:Coyote vs. Acme
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Times: 1pm\, 7:30pm\nAfter decades of being blown to bits by bo
 mbs\, demolished by dynamite\, mangled by magnets\, battered by boulders\,
  trampled by trains\, tricked by tunnels\, sprung by springs\, steamrolled
  by steamrollers\, maligned by misfires\, bedeviled by bungees\, rattled b
 y rockets\, backstabbed by bat suits\, rocked by rocket skates\, upended b
 y unicycles\, quaked by quake pills\, rubberized by rogue bands\, and hurl
 ed headlong off every cliff in the Southwest\, Wile E. Coyote (Genius) fin
 ally fights back. Teaming up with billboard accident lawyer Kevin Avery (W
 ill Forte)\, he takes on slick corporate counsel Buddy Crane (John Cena) a
 nd ACME\, Inc.\, the profit-obsessed conglomerate behind every one of the 
 Coyote’s chaotic catastrophes.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/c
 oyote-vs-acme\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/coyote-vs-acme
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:8a6025b0c82fe565d6026ac2c312d68419a20e06@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20260919T013100Z
DTSTART:20260919T170000Z
DTEND:20260919T190000Z
SUMMARY:Practical Magic 2
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Times: 1pm\, 4pm\, 7pm\nStarring Sandra Bullock and Nicole Kidm
 an\, Practical Magic 2 returns to a world steeped in moonlit mischief and 
 powerful ancestral magic\, as the Owens sisters must confront the dark cur
 se that threatens to unravel their family once and for all in a must-see c
 inematic event of fun\, magic and mayhem.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.co
 m/movie/practical-magic-2\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/bosto
 n/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/practical-magic-2
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:5b228448cfaff19beeec4a70ce2a537239060655@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20260919T013100Z
DTSTART:20260919T171000Z
DTEND:20260919T191000Z
SUMMARY:Filipiñana
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Times: 1:10pm\, 3:20pm\, 5:30pm\, 7:40pm\nAmid stifling heat an
 d pervasive drought\, Isabel (Jorrybell Agoto)\, a 17-year-old Ilokana fro
 m the rural north\, works at a posh country club outside Manila\, lining u
 p golf balls for powerful men to drive into the verdant horizon. New to th
 e job\, she wanders the immaculate grounds sampling its luxuries as member
 s\, including an industrialist and his expatriate niece\, the club preside
 nt and his pampered wife\, and a slew of Chinese tourists\, engage in a co
 mplex dance with the club’s doting and subservient staff. But something 
 is rotting beneath the pristine fairways of the elite resort\, as Isabel d
 iscovers when she tries to return a mislaid golf club to its patriarchal d
 irector\, Dr. Palanca (Teroy Guzman). The deeper she journeys into its mos
 t exclusive corners\, the closer she gets to the violent truths of the clu
 b\, her native Philippines\, and her own past..\nhttps://www.westnewtoncin
 ema.com/movie/filipiana\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/filipiana
END:VEVENT
