  unforgiving wilderness\, the real threat isn’t the terrain - it’s the
  betrayal and violence festering within their ranks. Surrounded by greed\,
  suspicion\, and danger\, Samuel must risk everything to reunite with his 
 child.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/the-weight\nFrom Pushpin Bo
 ston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
