SUMMARY:The Weight
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Times: 4:15pm\, 7:15pm\nWhen Samuel (Hawke) is torn from his da
 ughter and sent to a brutal prison\, Warden Clancy (Crowe) offers a high-s
 takes proposition: smuggle gold out of a remote mine with a dangerous crew
  of prisoners and he’ll win his freedom. But as the group journeys into 
 the unforgiving wilderness\, the real threat isn’t the terrain - it’s 
 the betrayal and violence festering within their ranks. Surrounded by gree
 d\, suspicion\, and danger\, Samuel must risk everything to reunite with h
 is child.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/the-weight\nFrom Pushpin
