BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d542174a9dd6369ca1990c32f707df1d83595bfb@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20260919T013100Z
DTSTART:20261002T223000Z
DTEND:20261003T003000Z
SUMMARY:THE AIRWAVES BELONGED TO THE PEOPLE: WBCN AND THE
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:"I watched the movie with awe…" — Ty Burr\, The Boston Glob
 e THE AIRWAVES BELONGED TO THE PEOPLE: WBCN AND THE AMERICAN REVOLUTION te
 lls the story of the legendary Boston rock station that transformed broadc
 asting through groundbreaking music\, fearless journalism\, and the counte
 rculture that shaped a generation. Built from rare photographs\, unseen fo
 otage\, and never-before-heard broadcasts\, the film captures WBCN-FM from
  1968 to 1974: Bruce Springsteen's first radio interview\, Patti Smith's f
 irst live radio broadcast\, Jane Fonda and Abbie Hoffman in the thick of t
 he era\, and a time when three dollars got you into the Boston Tea Party t
 o see The Who\, the Velvet Underground\, or Led Zeppelin. More than rock &
  roll history\, it's an entertaining\, music-filled journey through journa
 lism\, activism\, and free expression—whose themes could not be more tim
 ely.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/the-airwaves-belonged-to-the-
 people-wbcn-and-the\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/the-airwaves-belonged-to-the-peo
 ple-wbcn-and-the
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:6b56f9e06ee133210bb79201009e87fecb19874f@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20260919T013100Z
DTSTART:20261007T223000Z
DTEND:20261008T003000Z
SUMMARY:BrainStorm
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:BrainStorm follows six compelling people living with bipolar on
  their journeys from devastation to recovery. The film connects their expe
 riences with the latest bipolar brain science to shed light on potential c
 auses and successful treatments. The film closes with a message of hope\, 
 showing that it is possible to thrive while living on the bipolar spectrum
 .\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/brainstorm\nFrom Pushpin Boston:
  https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/brainstorm
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
